                        "review": "I give this 8/10 ~ This is a must play in Winter Wolf 's Loren universe (Why is the total view is Mix? curious ~) And this game must have a sequel, please! The ending scream for it!! There is no way it end clip hanging like that !~ \r\nThe romance choices for 3 sisters are really unique, I've played all routes. I assure you all routes are refreshing and interesting when comparing them all. For example, Tiberius is much more interested in Joanne than Kira, the romance seems natural, engaging and lovely dovey. With Kira, it's seems one way, standoffish and awkward. Therjalla romance is funnier with Tharlia (the end though, I don't like the progress, I find Tharlia is really forceful and childish), she is mature, calm and indulging toward Joanne, though.... It worth trying them all ~~\r\nI have a blast playing this game ~ I'll move on to tale from the underworld now <3",
